OL,3,GNEWSABus gate to be paused after market
OL,4,Atraders complain                       
OL,6,FA controversial bus gate will be       
OL,7,Fsuspended in the run-up to Christmas   
OL,8,Fafter market traders complained that   
OL,9,Fcustomers had been facing long delays  
OL,10,Fin Sheffield city centre.              
OL,12,FThe complaints from Moor Market        
OL,13,Fstallholders prompted a meeting with   
OL,14,FSheffield City Council, which agreed   
OL,15,Fthat traffic levels had increased in   
OL,16,Frecent weeks.                          
OL,18,FThe council said it would temporarily  
OL,19,Fsuspend both bus gates on Furnival Gate
OL,20,Ffrom Friday but would reinstate them   
OL,21,Fonce more traffic surveys had been     
OL,22,Fconducted.                             
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
