OL,3,GNEWSABus gate to be paused after market
OL,4,Atraders complain                       
OL,6,FBruce Payne, of The Market Chippy,     
OL,7,Fsaid: "I want the council to have a    
OL,8,Fcomplete rethink. The people who have  
OL,9,Fbeen impacted by the gridlock won't    
OL,10,Freturn to the city centre, there are   
OL,11,Fother places for them to go."          
